<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50774" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππο-κόμος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>groom, esquire, who attended the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππεύς</span>
			<i>in war</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.85
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				88
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.6
			</span></i>: generally, <i>groom</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				261d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.371.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				13.8.3
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. τῶν καμήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππό-κομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμη</span>)
				<i>decked with horsehair</i>, epith. of a helmet (not in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.132
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				116
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήληξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.797
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυφάλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.339
				</span></i>
			.</div>
